From 1e301ee59e04592141d5d2ac58ba0472b5a34b95 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 05:56:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 5a: linked balance payments (new files and tests)

Adds the balance-payment feature as new files only:
- balance_math.dart: pure outstanding and validation logic
- balance_repository.dart: lookup by exact receipt number, open balances,
  and recording a payment as a new balance receipt (own daily serial,
  -B suffix, original receipt never changed)
- balance_receipt_view.dart / balance_receipt_printing.dart: the balance
  receipt text, WhatsApp message and thermal print template
- screens/balance_payment_page.dart, widgets/balance_payment_button.dart,
  widgets/balance_receipt_preview.dart: the cashier Balance Payment page
- tests, including a legacy-layout test proving receipts saved before this
  change still read back as sales

Nothing existing is modified in this commit. The edits to Receipt, the
cashier screen, history page, print and WhatsApp services follow in
apply_phase5.ps1 (phase 5b).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
